  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Stasiun riset GenoPath",
    "overview": "PROPOSED scientific research workspace: horizontal navigation, real analysis records and provenance, fluid desktop width, functional surface hierarchy and restrained perceptible interaction. Original campus, garlic motif and contributor scene remain.",
